    "Id": "vehiclechassisdef_gerrida_GDR-F",
    "Name": "Gerrida",
    "Details": "The Gerrida is a Society super-heavy hovertank designed as a fast skirmisher capable of identifying and overwhelming weak points in enemy formations. Its distinctive radial layout, articulated hover pads, and flotation hull allow it to operate effectively across difficult terrain and water, while an XXL engine provides exceptional mobility for a vehicle of its size. Designed with vehicular jump jets in mind, the Gerrida combines unusual maneuverability with heavy protection, though its advanced construction limits deployment primarily to elite Society vehicle crews.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Vehicle Adv. Stealth\n<b>Structure:</b> Vehicle Composite\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       220     70\n<b>Left</b>         200     70\n<b>Right</b>       200     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      970    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Distracting</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Gerrida"
  },
  "YangsThoughts": "Twelve Medium Chemical Lasers give this thing one hell of a punch without cooking the crew, and the Clan ER Medium Laser gives it a little extra reach. The Supercharger gets it where it needs to be, while the Angel ECM, Bloodhound Probe, Light TAG, and Laser AMS give it plenty of tricks to stay alive and find its targets. For a hundred-ton hovertank, this thing’s surprisingly well equipped for hunting.",
